2026-07-27 22:07:11,047 - DEBUG - Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/embeddings', 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-c9d45c4c-9b3a-47c2-92dd-d569056470b8', 'post_parser': <function Embeddings.create.<locals>.parser at 0x7fe7c75868e0>, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'input': 'Your Perspective Matters: Join the NIS360 survey\n\nENISA launches a survey for both national authorities and high criticality entities under NIS2 in preparation of the next edition of the NIS360 report. Following the publication of the NIS360 2026 report in May 2026, a new assessment cycle has now started with the launch of data collection and surveys for the NIS360 2027 edition. For this assessment, data is collected via an online platform using two structured questionnaires designed to assess cybersecurity maturity by combining insights from the private sector with perspectives from national authorities. The NIS360 surveys are carefully designed to ensure that data collected each year remains comparable and reflects overall trends. All responses are analysed in aggregate form, ensuring confidentiality.', 'model': 'text-embedding-3-small', 'encoding_format': 'base64'}}
