2026-08-04 06:13:17,424 - DEBUG - Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/embeddings', 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-4457f3fe-cd7d-4ede-aa2f-8fbfe15d4c5b', 'post_parser': <function Embeddings.create.<locals>.parser at 0x7f9246ce6a20>, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'input': "18 Malicious npm Packages Deliver Cross-Platform RAT to Alibaba Tool Users\n\nOn Windows, it terminates the Alilang enterprise security, VPN, and office productivity app and replaces its core code with a trojanized version. On Linux, it downloads a binary payload to /tmp, runs it as a detached process, and deletes the file from disk after it's loaded into memory. On macOS, it inserts a malicious background script into ~/.zshrc and sets up a 10-minute Launch Agent. The final payload is a complex backdoor equipped with comprehensive command execution, arbitrary file upload and download, host reconnaissance, payload staging, and lateral movement capabilities.", 'model': 'text-embedding-3-small', 'encoding_format': 'base64'}}
