fields but provides no victim total. PNLD reported 108,429 police registrations and support for all 43 Home Office police forces in its 2025-26 annual summary. That is a user-base figure, not a breach-victim count.', 'model': 'text-embedding-3-small', 'encoding_format': 'base64'}}
